# Build products and captures — all regenerable, none versioned.
#
# shots/ in particular is deliberately NOT committed: it tracks how the site
# currently looks, so a committed copy goes stale the moment a page changes and
# then silently builds a teaser of the old design. capture-shots.sh reproduces
# the whole directory from the preview server in about two minutes.
.work/
out/
shots/
*.mov
*.mp4
